### Active
- Planning cross-account IDOR/BOLA testing on same-origin `/api/top/ark/...` read actions, especially `GetRawApiKey` (A reading B's API key by `Id` + `ProjectName`) and other read-only actions accepting `AccountId`/`ProjectName`.
