- MCP uid clicks fail inside cross-origin iframes; only CDP coordinate clicks work.
- Account B ID/API keys unknown; needed before IDOR baseline.

## Next Move
1. In page 2 (isolated `accountB`), navigate to `https://console.byteplus.com/ark/region:ap-southeast-1/overview`, capture B's cookies, CSRF token, account ID, and `ListApiKeys` response/API key IDs via same-origin `/api/top/ark/ap-southeast-1/2024-01-01/ListApiKeys`.
2. Using Account A session/cookies, send read-only POST to `GetRawApiKey` with B's key `Id` and `ProjectName`; compare against A's own-key baseline to determine whether cross-account raw key disclosure is possible. Do not perform destructive or write actions without test-owned justification.

